Package: affection-vpn
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Eugene Orefkov
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libgtk-3-0 (>= 3.16), libayatana-appindicator3-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Description: Native Linux Xray (VLESS) VPN client with subscription support
 A native Linux VPN client built with Flutter that uses the Xray-core
 (VLESS protocol) behind the scenes. Supports subscription import,
 automatic server selection, and per-app VPN routing.
 .
 Bundles its own Xray-core runtime and geoip/geosite databases, so no
 separate core installation is required.
